  "notes": "{学|まな}ぶ is a godan verb meaning to study or learn, often implying deeper or academic learning.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive)\n- No standard intransitive pair\n- Pattern: [noun]⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{学|まな}ぶ\n\nCONTRAST WITH SIMILAR VERBS:\n- {学|まな}ぶ: to study/learn (formal, deep understanding)\n- ⟦{習|なら}う→習う：00479_narau⟧: to learn (from a teacher, practical skills)\n- ⟦{覚|おぼ}える→覚える：00739_oboeru⟧: to memorize, remember\n- ⟦{勉強|べんきょう}→勉強：00770_benkyou⟧⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧: to study (general term)\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- 〜⟦から→から：00504_kara⟧{学|まな}ぶ: to learn from ~\n- ⟦{経験|けいけん}→経験：01179_keiken⟧⟦から→から：00504_kara⟧{学|まな}ぶ: to learn from experience\n- ⟦{歴史|れきし}→歴史：02267_rekishi⟧⟦から→から：00504_kara⟧{学|まな}ぶ: to learn from history\n- ⟦{失敗|しっぱい}→失敗：01636_shippai⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{学|まな}ぶ: to learn from failure\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- ⟦{学校|がっこう}→学校：00055_gakkou⟧: school\n- ⟦{学生|がくせい}→学生：00610_gakusei⟧: student\n- ⟦{学問|がくもん}→学問：02604_gakumon⟧: learning, scholarship\n- ⟦{学者|がくしゃ}→学者：02544_gakusha⟧: scholar",
